      "sectionTitle": "Test Code Format",
      "headingId": null,
      "notes": "```py\n@jax.jit\n@jax.shard_map(mesh=mesh, in_specs=(spec_X, spec_X), out_specs=spec_X, check_vma=False)\ndef pshuffle_mm(lhs, rhs):\n    axis_size = jax.lax.axis_size('X')\n    axis_index = jax.lax.axis_index('X')\n    slice_size = lhs.shape[1] // axis_size\n\n    result = jax.lax.full((lhs.shape[0], rhs.shape[1]), 0.0, dtype=lhs.dtype)\n\n    for i in range(axis_size):\n        offset = (i + axis_index) % axis_size\n        lhs_slice = jax.lax.dynamic_slice_in_dim(lhs, start_index=offset*slice_size, slice_size=slice_size, axis=1)\n        result = result + lhs_slice@rhs\n        rhs = jax.lax.pshuffle(rhs, perm=[(i + 1) % axis_size for i in range(axis_size)], axis_name='X')\n    return result\n\npshuffle_result = pshuffle_mm(lhs, rhs)\ntree_all(tree_map(partial(np.allclose, rtol=0.001, atol=0.001), expected_matmul, pshuffle_result))\n```",
